    },
    {
      "title": "Teaching in the Lord's Law",
      "description": "Jehoshaphat sent out leaders, Levites and priests to teach the people throughout Judah about the Lord's law, which led to spiritual renewal in the land.",
      "verses": [
        {
          "bookId": 14,
          "chapter": 17,
          "verses": [
            7,
            8,
            9
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Alliance with Ahab and the Battle at Ramoth Gilead",
      "description": "Jehoshaphat formed an unfortunate alliance with the wicked King Ahab of Israel through marriage and went with him to war against Ramoth Gilead. The prophet Micaiah warned against this, and Ahab was killed in battle.",
