        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Judicial Reforms and Appointment of Judges",
      "description": "Jehoshaphat carried out important judicial reforms in Judah. He appointed judges throughout the land and instructed them to judge fairly, for they did not judge for humans but for the Lord.",
      "verses": [
        {
          "bookId": 14,
          "chapter": 19,
