          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Prayer and Victory over Moab and Ammon",
      "description": "When a large army from Moab, Ammon and Mount Se'ir threatened Judah, Jehoshaphat turned to the Lord in prayer and fasting. God answered the prayer through the prophet Jahaziel, and the enemies were defeated without Judah having to fight.",
