    {
      "title": "Rebuke by the Prophet Jehu",
      "description": "After Jehoshaphat returned from his alliance with Ahab, the prophet Jehu son of Hanani met him and rebuked him for helping the wicked and loving those who hate the Lord, but also acknowledged the good that Jehoshaphat had done.",
